{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H10、H11提供了强烈亲近与快乐将逝的依据，H2、H4说明悬念仍在，而M40把强度退下后的身体松脱解释为直接反应，没有新增事件或把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"从H6的时间意识、H10与H11中真实发生却正在过去的快乐，以及H2尚未解决的悬念，可以合理推出他开始追问幸福能维持多久，没有否定幸福的真实性或改变原有主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H9的急切与悬而未决、H5中因期待未造成伤害而开始松动的身体状态，为M28所描述的心理过程提供了历史支点，使他发现不必紧抓对方也能继续感受在意，而不是新增外部事件或把松弛解释成放弃关系。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都交代了具体感受及其心理成因，且将关键历史依据和局部心理过程写进了解释，即使不看听感记录，也能读懂情绪变化及其因果关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9dd8096e-22ae-4907-97c6-2f0c22bd9a6d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T143742492240Z", "elapsed_seconds": 165.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:40:27.523953+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "528bd99fbbcbaa14f04ea052bc5b7f7726691338e6c91b56f9ca26516777e360", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5